            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Isaac Newton</strong><br>\nIsaac Newton was born on January 4, 1643, in Woolsthorpe, England. His early life was challenging as his father had passed away before he was born, and his mother remarried when he was three, leaving him to be raised by his grandmother. Despite these hardships, Newton was an excellent student, and his mother pulled him out of school to help with the family farm. However, Newton showed little interest in farming and was soon sent back to finish his education.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Newton's Education</strong><br>\nNewton attended The King's School in Grantham before enrolling at Trinity College, Cambridge in 1661. At Cambridge, he studied a traditional curriculum but was more interested in the advanced science of the modern philosophers. When the Great Plague closed the university in 1665, Newton returned home. It was during this period of seclusion that he began formulating the theory of gravitation.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Breakthroughs in Mathematics</strong><br>\nWhile at his family's estate, Newton made groundbreaking advances in mathematics. He developed the binomial theorem and began working on what would later become calculus. Newton's work on calculus continued for many years, and he used these mathematical methods to solve problems in physics and astronomy.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
